<TEI xmlns="http://www.tei-c.org/ns/1.0" xml:id="KR6b0059-en-74f90843" type="transl"><teiHeader><fileDesc><titleStmt><title>Translation of 賢愚經 into (English)</title><editor role="translator">AI - Gemini</editor></titleStmt><publicationStmt><ab>published electronically as part of the TLS project at https://hxwd.org</ab><availability status="2"><ab>This work has been licensed for use in the TLS</ab></availability></publicationStmt><sourceDesc><bibl><title/>2026</bibl><ab>Translation of <bibl corresp="#KR6b0059"><title xml:lang="och">賢愚經</title></bibl> into <lang xml:lang="en">English</lang>.</ab></sourceDesc></fileDesc><profileDesc><creation resp="#CH">Initially created: <date>2026-02-24T21:45:22.272+09:00</date> by CH</creation></profileDesc></teiHeader><text><body><div><head>Translated parts</head><p xml:id="KR6b0059-start"><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.30" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">(your features) were still handsome,</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.31" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">and your brilliant talent surpassed the crowd, with no one able to equal you.</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.32" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">Because of making offerings to a Pìzhīfó,</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.33" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">you were rich and noble in every life,</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.34" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">and had the karmic condition to attain liberation.</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.35" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">Thus, Great King! All sentient beings with physical forms</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.36" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">should guard their body and mouth (actions and speech),</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.37" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">and not wrongly commit evil or lightly scold others."</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.38" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">At that time, King Bōsīnì, along with all his ministers and the entire assembly,</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.39" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">upon hearing what the Buddha said about causes, conditions, and karmic retribution,</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.40" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">all gave rise to faith and reverence, and felt moved in the Buddha's presence.</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.41" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">With this faith,</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.42" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">some attained the first fruit (of stream-entry) up to the fourth fruit (of arhatship),</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.43" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">some aroused the supreme mind of equality (bodhicitta),</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.44" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">and still others attained the state of non-retrogression (from the path to enlightenment).</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.45" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">All harbored admiration, respectfully venerated the Buddha's teachings,</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.46" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">joyfully accepting and obeying, and all together they practiced them.</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.48-h" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">(9) Chapter 9: The Karmic Origins of Jīncái</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.48" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">Thus have I heard:</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.49" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">At one time, the Buddha was in the Jeta's Grove, Anāthapiṇḍika's Park, in the kingdom of Shèwèi,</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.50" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">together with one thousand two hundred and fifty venerable disciples.</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.51" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">At that time, in the city, there was a great elder (wealthy householder),</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.52" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">whose wife gave birth to a son, named Jīncái.</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.53" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">That child was extraordinarily handsome and peerless in the world.</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.54" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">This child, from a past life's karma, was born with clenched fists,</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.55" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">his parents were astonished and considered it inauspicious.</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.56" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">They immediately opened the child's hands,</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.57" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">and observed his auspicious marks,</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.58" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">seeing two gold coins in each of the child's hands.</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.59" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">The parents were delighted,</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.60" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">and immediately took them.</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.61" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">After they were taken, they reappeared in the same spot,</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.62" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">and they immediately took them again, and they reappeared as before.</seg><seg corresp="#KR6b0059_T_002-0358b.63" generatedBy="bot-gemini-2.5-flash" xml:lang="en" resp="#CH" modified="2026-02-24T21:45:58.228+09:00">In this way, they diligently collected gold coins until their storehouses were full.</seg></p></div></body></text></TEI>